        {
          "id": "3.1",
          "type": "open",
          "q": "Evaluate: (i) ∫cos√x/√x dx; (ii) ∫e^(3 log x)·x⁴ dx; (iii) ∫sec²x/√(1 − tan²x) dx; (iv) ∫cosec x(cosec x + cot x)dx.",
          "answer": "(i) t = √x, dt = dx/(2√x): 2∫cos t dt = 2 sin√x + c.\n(ii) e^(3 log x) = x³, so ∫x⁷dx = x⁸/8 + c.\n(iii) t = tan x: ∫dt/√(1 − t²) = sin⁻¹(tan x) + c.\n(iv) ∫(cosec²x + cosec x cot x)dx = −cot x − cosec x + c.",
          "years": [
            "April 2024"
          ]
        }
