          "id": "5.1",
          "type": "open",
          "q": "Find ∫x²/(x² + 6x + 12) dx.",
          "answer": "x²/(x² + 6x + 12) = 1 − (6x + 12)/(x² + 6x + 12).\n6x + 12 = 3(2x + 6) − 6. So ∫ = x − 3 log(x² + 6x + 12) + 6∫dx/((x + 3)² + 3).\n= x − 3 log(x² + 6x + 12) + (6/√3)tan⁻¹((x + 3)/√3) + C\n= x − 3 log(x² + 6x + 12) + 2√3 tan⁻¹((x + 3)/√3) + C.",
          "years": [
            "April 2024"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5.2",
          "type": "open",
          "q": "Find ∫x²/[(x² + 4)(x² + 9)] dx.",
          "answer": "Put x² = t: t/[(t + 4)(t + 9)] = A/(t + 4) + B/(t + 9) with A = −4/5, B = 9/5.\n∫ = −(4/5)(1/2)tan⁻¹(x/2) + (9/5)(1/3)tan⁻¹(x/3) + C = −(2/5)tan⁻¹(x/2) + (3/5)tan⁻¹(x/3) + C."
        }
